# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# Python bytecode from tools/
__pycache__/

# uv virtualenv for the Python tools in tools/
#
# No trailing slash, here or on data/logs: a worktree shares neither, and linking
# the main checkout's rather than fetching a second copy is the cheap way round
# that. A `dir/` pattern matches a directory and not a symlink to one, so the link
# shows up as untracked and waits to be committed by accident.
.venv

# Reference papers, fetched rather than committed: arXiv grants a licence to
# distribute on arXiv, not to bundle in an MIT crate. reference/README.md says
# what belongs here and how to re-fetch it.
reference/*.pdf
reference/*.zip
